<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila money market closed due to rains.</title>
<headline>Manila money market closed due to rains.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine central bank said on Tuesday there will be no money market trading due to the heavy rains.</p>
<p>The average interbank call loan rate rose to 14.15625 percent on Monday from 14.0625 percent after the central bank raised last week banks' liquidity reserves by one percentage point to prevent peso speculation.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63) 2-841-8937</p>
